{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["לא תגע בו יד — the one touching the mountain, as I said. מות יומת — from a distance they shall put him to death, so that they do not approach the mountain to put him to death and thereby they too become liable for death. Therefore לא תגע בו יד, to put him to death, but rather they shall shoot him with arrows from a distance, or they shall throw stones at him to stone him." "במשוך היובל — when the Shekhinah withdraws and the sound of the shofars and the torches cease."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "The lemma לא תגע בו יד is repeated in the body; rendered literally each time."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:08.357776888Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}